<title>SWITZERLAND: Canal Plus Nethold merger deal signed.</title>
<headline>Canal Plus Nethold merger deal signed.</headline>
<dateline>ZUG, Switzerland 1996-12-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Compagnie Financiere Richemont AG said a definitive agreement had been signed to merge Canal Plus with Nethold BV's operations in Europe, as agreed in principle in September.</p>
<p>Nethhold is jointly held by Richemont and MIH Holdings Ltd.</p>
<p>&quot;The merger is dependent upon, inter alia, certain regulatory and other approvals,&quot; it said in a statement. &quot;It is anticipated that the transaction will be closed during March or April of next year.&quot;</p>
<p>Richemont and MIH will have a combined stake of 20 percent in Canal Plus after the merger.</p>
<p>-- Zurich +41 1 631 7340</p>
</text>
